WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:17.142
I know what you're thinking.

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:19.811
Noah Flynn is stupid hot,

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:23.190
but Lee and I developed
a list of friendship rules.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:25.734
Lee was responsible for
rule number nine,

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.361
which specifically states:

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:29.238
"Relatives
of your best friend

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.906
are totally off-limits."

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.368
I know that we don't really
see eye to eye on things,

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.620
but I'm… I'm desperate.

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:39.456
So, maybe if you could just
stop by the booth

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.415
for a little…

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.251
I don't know. I just…

00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:44.044
It would mean a lot to me.

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:47.130
I know that you were
probably expecting Olivia,

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:48.423
so we don't have to do
anything

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:49.466
if you don't want to.

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:53.470
Erm, truth be told, I've
never kissed anyone before.

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:54.471
It's not that I haven't

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:55.764
wanted to,
don't get me wrong.

00:00:55.848 --> 00:00:57.474
Sophomore year spring fling,

00:00:57.558 --> 00:00:59.935
I was dancing
with Randy Melrose.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.979
You know,
a romantic song came on.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.146
I was like:
"What will happen?",

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:05.524
but… Until it just didn't--

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.958
I cannot just be another one
of your conquests.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.253
Is that
what you think of me?

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:28.005
That's what everyone thinks
of you.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.715
Don't forget we're going out
on Saturday

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:30.924
to celebrate your big news.

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.467
We don't have to, mum.

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:33.677
Of course we do!

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.304
It's not every day
you get accepted

00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:36.930
to an Ivy League school.

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:38.223
Which school?

00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:40.350
Harvard.

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:43.687
Are you shitting me?

00:01:44.188 --> 00:01:45.189
That's amazing!

00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:46.231
Ok.

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:48.275
Here's
how this is going to work.

00:01:49.484 --> 00:01:50.360
Rules.

00:01:50.444 --> 00:01:53.405
If we do this,
nobody can know.

00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:54.406
Ok?

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:57.117
At least until… I figure out
a way to tell Lee.

00:01:57.201 --> 00:01:58.493
It has to be that way.

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:00.454
Is there something going on
between you two?

00:02:01.205 --> 00:02:03.332
No, no. Nothing is going on.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.793
Ok.

00:02:07.544 --> 00:02:09.254
What the fuck?

00:02:09.338 --> 00:02:11.423
Lee? I can explain.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:13.717
-Unbelievable.
-Wait, no!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.093
Stay here, please.

00:02:16.011 --> 00:02:17.763
You were never meant
to find out this way.

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:19.056
Seems like I was never
meant to find out

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:20.015
at all, doesn't it?

00:02:20.098 --> 00:02:21.058
Hey, lay off her, Lee.

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:22.392
It's not like
it's all Elle's fault.

00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:23.602
You're trying to
tell me that

00:02:23.685 --> 00:02:25.229
you two
have not slept together?

00:02:29.066 --> 00:02:30.192
I knew it.

00:02:30.275 --> 00:02:32.736
So you really just have been
fucking my brother

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:33.820
and lying to me.

00:02:33.904 --> 00:02:35.322
You're acting
like a hurt little bitch!

00:02:38.909 --> 00:02:41.203
-Noah, get off him!
-Stop!

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:43.747
Why did you come
downstairs?

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.916
I told you to stay inside!

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.001
It's like you wanted
to make things worse!

00:02:48.085 --> 00:02:49.753
What is wrong with you?

00:02:50.838 --> 00:02:53.257
You cannot pin
all this on me.

00:02:54.716 --> 00:02:55.884
Just leave me alone.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.096
No problem.

00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:08.438
Elle.

00:03:10.232 --> 00:03:11.108
I think you're next up.

00:03:15.988 --> 00:03:17.114
I'm sorry, Noah.

00:03:18.866 --> 00:03:20.325
I can't.

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:21.618
Elle, wait. Please.

00:03:22.119 --> 00:03:23.036
Elle.

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:29.334
Why?

00:03:30.544 --> 00:03:31.461
Because I love you.

00:03:36.008 --> 00:03:37.342
Standing here,

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:39.928
in front of everyone,

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:41.763
I'm telling you

00:03:42.806 --> 00:03:43.974
that I love you.

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.475
I'm sorry.

00:03:46.518 --> 00:03:47.394
I just…

00:03:48.103 --> 00:03:50.772
I can't keep hurting people
that I care about

00:03:50.856 --> 00:03:51.857
because of you.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:52.900
I was wrong.

00:03:53.901 --> 00:03:55.402
But I'd be lying to you
again

00:03:55.485 --> 00:03:57.988
if I didn't tell you that
I love him

00:03:58.572 --> 00:03:59.990
with every bit of my heart.

00:04:01.116 --> 00:04:03.785
Sitting here in front of…

00:04:05.704 --> 00:04:07.789
no one in particular,

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:10.751
I'm saying I love you.

00:04:11.543 --> 00:04:12.753
And I love you.

00:04:14.004 --> 00:04:14.880
Goodbye.

00:04:15.672 --> 00:04:17.508
Come on, Shelly.
Don't say it like that.

00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:19.676
I'll see you soon
and you can come and visit.

00:04:20.511 --> 00:04:22.221
-We can make this work.
-Ok, stop.

00:04:22.721 --> 00:04:25.057
And don't turn back
for a final wave.

00:04:25.891 --> 00:04:28.143
That is way too cheesy
and romantic.

00:04:28.894 --> 00:04:29.770
Even for me.

00:04:30.771 --> 00:04:32.439
Why were you so upset
when you left?

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:35.317
I guess I was looking at

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.194
this whole life that you
have out there without me

00:04:37.861 --> 00:04:38.862
and I'm…

00:04:40.864 --> 00:04:42.533
I'm definitely not used to
seeing you around

00:04:42.616 --> 00:04:43.700
all those college girls.

00:04:44.201 --> 00:04:46.286
Elle, I told you Chloe's
just a friend.

00:04:46.912 --> 00:04:48.080
I want to believe you.

00:04:48.163 --> 00:04:49.915
There's no reason
you shouldn't.

00:04:49.998 --> 00:04:52.417
If you're telling me
that nothing has happened,

00:04:55.087 --> 00:04:56.129
then I believe you.

00:05:05.597 --> 00:05:06.974
I just wanted
to wish you luck

00:05:07.057 --> 00:05:08.267
for your competition
tomorrow.

00:05:10.853 --> 00:05:11.895
You remembered.

00:05:11.979 --> 00:05:13.480
Of course I remembered.

00:05:14.064 --> 00:05:15.148
I wish I could be there.

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.381
[inaudible]
that you kissed him,

00:05:42.718 --> 00:05:44.553
but I need you
to tell me anything.

00:05:47.931 --> 00:05:48.932
Do you love him?

00:05:57.357 --> 00:05:59.902
Please try to remember
what I'm about to say.

00:06:02.404 --> 00:06:03.780
It's you, Noah.

00:06:08.243 --> 00:06:09.286
It's always been you.

00:06:09.786 --> 00:06:11.538
When you get off
the wait list for Harvard,

00:06:11.622 --> 00:06:14.541
maybe you and I
could go off campus

00:06:14.625 --> 00:06:15.959
and get an apartment
together.

00:06:17.002 --> 00:06:17.920
Wait, you mean like…

00:06:19.004 --> 00:06:20.756
Like get our own place?

00:06:21.882 --> 00:06:23.091
Yeah. Look.

00:06:24.176 --> 00:06:25.594
I've been online all day.

00:06:25.677 --> 00:06:27.304
There are some
pretty cool places.

00:06:29.973 --> 00:06:31.433
I got off the wait list.

00:06:34.061 --> 00:06:34.937
Harvard.

00:06:35.521 --> 00:06:36.480
What?

00:06:40.817 --> 00:06:42.402
I thought you could use
a night in.

00:06:42.486 --> 00:06:43.612
You deserve it.

00:06:48.909 --> 00:06:49.785
What's wrong?

00:06:49.868 --> 00:06:51.161
I have this thing with Lee

00:06:51.245 --> 00:06:53.080
and we've been planning it
for weeks--

00:06:53.163 --> 00:06:55.040
Please don't tell me
it's a bucket list thing.

00:06:55.123 --> 00:06:56.959
I'm sorry. I feel horrible.

00:06:57.042 --> 00:06:58.544
You're actually going to go?

00:06:58.627 --> 00:06:59.586
I made you dinner.

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:02.381
It's not like I want to go,
Noah.

00:07:02.464 --> 00:07:04.675
We're going to be in Boston
together all next year.

00:07:04.758 --> 00:07:06.677
I just feel like I'm leaving
him all alone at Berkeley.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.637
Me asking you to come
to Boston isn't some, like,

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.639
evil plot to make you leave
Lee behind.

00:07:10.722 --> 00:07:13.725
No. I'm not… That's not
what I'm saying at all.

00:07:13.809 --> 00:07:15.644
Listen, I'm going to be back
in an hour, ok?

00:07:15.727 --> 00:07:16.770
I swear.

00:07:17.563 --> 00:07:19.231
Alright.
Do whatever you want.

00:07:19.314 --> 00:07:20.274
You know what? I…

00:07:21.358 --> 00:07:22.734
I don't like fighting.

00:07:24.611 --> 00:07:25.487
Me neither.

00:07:27.531 --> 00:07:28.824
But I'll fight for you.

00:07:30.826 --> 00:07:32.244
I'll fight for you, too.

00:08:00.731 --> 00:08:02.024
You know
what I keep thinking about?

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.903
Why the guy that you kissed
in front of the whole world

00:08:05.986 --> 00:08:07.654
is wearing the costume
that you asked me to wear.

00:08:07.738 --> 00:08:08.739
-Why is he wearing it?
-Noah!

00:08:08.822 --> 00:08:10.741
You always just pull things
way out of proportion.

00:08:10.824 --> 00:08:12.701
It's very clear that he's
still after you and if you--

00:08:12.784 --> 00:08:14.870
He's not. Nothing's going on
between Marco and me.

00:08:14.953 --> 00:08:16.288
If you think that
he's not still after you,

00:08:16.371 --> 00:08:17.497
then you're being naïve.

00:08:17.581 --> 00:08:18.624
It's embarrassing.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.792
It's embarrassing.

00:08:22.961 --> 00:08:24.254
You still want Elle.

00:08:24.338 --> 00:08:26.673
And everybody here
knows that.

00:08:26.757 --> 00:08:27.799
I said shut up.

00:08:27.883 --> 00:08:29.343
The sooner you get that
into your thick skull,

00:08:29.426 --> 00:08:30.385
the sooner you can--

00:08:31.595 --> 00:08:32.679
Noah!

00:08:36.517 --> 00:08:37.601
I'm not doing this.

00:08:39.228 --> 00:08:41.647
I know better than trying
to stop you going to Boston.

00:08:44.107 --> 00:08:45.651
But, if you do decide to go,

00:08:48.487 --> 00:08:49.863
it's not going to be
with me.

00:08:51.949 --> 00:08:53.992
So, that's… it?

00:08:55.077 --> 00:08:57.621
The fact that we love
each other means nothing?

00:08:58.914 --> 00:09:00.332
I do love you, but…

00:09:01.124 --> 00:09:03.043
Maybe sometimes
loving each other

00:09:03.126 --> 00:09:04.127
just isn't enough.

00:09:05.546 --> 00:09:07.673
-Hey Shelly.
-Hi Noah.

00:09:10.342 --> 00:09:11.510
It's been a long time.

00:09:12.094 --> 00:09:13.136
You seem so grown up.

00:09:15.889 --> 00:09:17.724
I was going to say
the same thing about you.

00:09:22.771 --> 00:09:25.107
You know, if feels like
yesterday you were just

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:27.150
crashing your scooter down
the driveway.

00:09:28.068 --> 00:09:29.152
Well, I'm a much better
driver now.

00:09:29.236 --> 00:09:30.279
Oh.

00:09:30.362 --> 00:09:31.780
I even have
my own motorcycle.

00:09:31.864 --> 00:09:32.739
Really?

00:09:35.617 --> 00:09:36.535
Ok, well.

00:09:36.618 --> 00:09:37.953
I mean,
when I'm in town again,

00:09:38.036 --> 00:09:39.913
we should go
for a ride together.

00:09:41.915 --> 00:09:44.293
I mean, if you'd like that.

00:09:45.502 --> 00:09:47.045
I would like that.
That sounds fun.

00:09:47.546 --> 00:09:49.089
Well, I've got to…

00:09:49.173 --> 00:09:50.465
I've got to go and see
some friends

00:09:50.549 --> 00:09:51.758
and I've got
an early flight, so…

00:09:51.842 --> 00:09:52.843
No, of course.

00:09:52.926 --> 00:09:54.636
But I'll…
No, no. I'll call you, ok?

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.513
Sure.
Yeah, if you've got time.

00:09:57.639 --> 00:09:58.515
I've got time.

00:10:03.103 --> 00:10:04.313
-I'm going to go.
-Ok.

00:10:04.396 --> 00:10:05.772
-Ok.
-Alright.

00:10:07.524 --> 00:10:08.817
-I'll see you later.
-Ok.

00:10:08.901 --> 00:10:11.486
-See you. Ok, bye.
-Bye.

